{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-training","title":"分布式训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/distributed-training","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式训练\">分布式训练</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当模型规模和数据规模增长到单个 GPU 无法承载时，分布式训练成为必然选择。分布式训练的核心问题是如何将计算和存储分摊到多个设备上，同时保持训练的正确性和效率。根据分拆维度的不同，主流的并行策略包括数据并行、模型并行（张量并行和流水线并行）以及它们的混合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;分布式训练策略&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数据并行&lt;br/&gt;每 GPU 完整模型&lt;br/&gt;数据分片&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;张量并行&lt;br/&gt;单层拆分到多 GPU&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;流水线并行&lt;br/&gt;不同层放不同 GPU&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;ZeRO&lt;br/&gt;分片优化器状态&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;3D 并行&lt;br/&gt;= 数据 + 张量 + 流水线&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"分布式训练策略\"] --&gt; B[\"数据并行&lt;br/&gt;每 GPU 完整模型&lt;br/&gt;数据分片\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"张量并行&lt;br/&gt;单层拆分到多 GPU\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"流水线并行&lt;br/&gt;不同层放不同 GPU\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"ZeRO&lt;br/&gt;分片优化器状态\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"3D 并行&lt;br/&gt;= 数据 + 张量 + 流水线\"]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>并行策略</th>\n<th>拆分维度</th>\n<th>通信量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>编程复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据并行</td>\n<td>batch</td>\n<td>梯度同步</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>张量并行</td>\n<td>层内参数</td>\n<td>激活值</td>\n<td>大层（MLP/Attention）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线并行</td>\n<td>层间</td>\n<td>激活值/梯度</td>\n<td>超深模型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeRO Stage 1</td>\n<td>优化器状态</td>\n<td>梯度同步</td>\n<td>大优化器状态</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeRO Stage 2</td>\n<td>+ 梯度</td>\n<td>梯度收集</td>\n<td>中等模型</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeRO Stage 3</td>\n<td>+ 参数</td>\n<td>参数收集</td>\n<td>超大模型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据并行\">数据并行</h2><p>数据并行是最常用的分布式策略。每个 GPU 持有模型的完整副本，训练数据被均匀分到各 GPU。每轮迭代中，各 GPU 独立计算前向和反向传播，然后通过 AllReduce 操作同步梯度，保证所有 GPU 上的模型参数一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.distributed as dist&#10;from torch.nn.parallel import DistributedDataParallel as DDP&#10;&#10;def setup(rank, world_size):&#10;    dist.init_process_group(&quot;nccl&quot;, rank=rank, world_size=world_size)&#10;    torch.cuda.set_device(rank)&#10;&#10;def train(rank, world_size):&#10;    setup(rank, world_size)&#10;    model = MyModel().to(rank)&#10;    model = DDP(model, device_ids=[rank])&#10;    optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3)&#10;    sampler = torch.utils.data.distributed.DistributedSampler(dataset, num_replicas=world_size, rank=rank)&#10;    dataloader = DataLoader(dataset, batch_size=32, sampler=sampler)&#10;    for epoch in range(100):&#10;        sampler.set_epoch(epoch)&#10;        for batch in dataloader:&#10;            loss = model(batch)&#10;            loss.backward()&#10;            optimizer.step()&#10;            optimizer.zero_grad()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.distributed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.parallel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DistributedDataParallel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DDP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rank, world_size):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dist.init_process_group(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nccl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rank, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">world_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">world_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    torch.cuda.set_device(rank)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rank, world_size):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    setup(rank, world_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MyModel().to(rank)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DDP(model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device_ids</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[rank])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sampler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.utils.data.distributed.DistributedSampler(dataset, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_replicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">world_size, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rank)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dataloader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DataLoader(dataset, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sampler.set_epoch(epoch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            optimizer.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            optimizer.zero_grad()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AllReduce 操作是数据并行的核心通信原语。Ring AllReduce 将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 GPU 组成环形拓扑，每个 GPU 只与相邻的两个通信，总通信量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2(N-1)/N \\times M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 为模型参数量），近似与 GPU 数量无关。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Ring AllReduce&#10;        G1[&quot;GPU 0&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₀&quot;] --&gt; G2[&quot;GPU 1&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₁&quot;]&#10;        G2 --&gt; G3[&quot;GPU 2&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₂&quot;]&#10;        G3 --&gt; G4[&quot;GPU 3&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₃&quot;]&#10;        G4 --&gt; G1&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Ring AllReduce\n        G1[\"GPU 0&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₀\"] --&gt; G2[\"GPU 1&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₁\"]\n        G2 --&gt; G3[\"GPU 2&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₂\"]\n        G3 --&gt; G4[\"GPU 3&lt;br/&gt;梯度 g₃\"]\n        G4 --&gt; G1\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"模型并行\">模型并行</h2><p>当单个模型无法放入一个 GPU 时，需要将模型拆分到多个设备上。</p>\n<p><strong>张量并行</strong>（Tensor Parallelism）将单个层的参数矩阵切分到多个 GPU。以 Transformer 的 MLP 层为例，第一个线性层按列切分，第二个按行切分，最终通过 AllReduce 合并输出。</p>\n<p><strong>流水线并行</strong>（Pipeline Parallelism）将模型的不同层放在不同的 GPU 上。朴素实现会导致严重的设备空闲（气泡）。GPipe 通过将 mini-batch 切分为微批次（micro-batch）并交错调度来减少气泡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torch.distributed.pipelining import SplitPoint, pipeline&#10;&#10;class ModelShard1(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.layers = nn.Sequential(*[TransformerBlock() for _ in range(12)])&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.layers(x)&#10;&#10;class ModelShard2(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.layers = nn.Sequential(*[TransformerBlock() for _ in range(12)])&#10;        self.head = nn.Linear(768, 50000)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.head(self.layers(x))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.distributed.pipelining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SplitPoint, pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelShard1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[TransformerBlock() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.layers(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModelShard2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[TransformerBlock() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span 